    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo waawutmo Solomon iri ilawaáts, giri báy,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy waawutmo iri warqáy amór múk Israeli, sleémeero giri tsuúq, qoomaarihe múk Israeli sleémero i sihhmiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós iri oó', «AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli, i xirfuuti, kudá' al'axweesantós tidá' aa oó' dír baabuúeé' Daudi gaa boo/ees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tidá' iwa oó', ‹Iimír aníng qoomaadá' muk'eé' nguwa duúx baraá yaamaá Misrír wa alé ay laarí, aníng gixsár naa tsawaár i káhh baraá yaamaá Israeliro tawa dír ta Dooeé' tleehhi oo tiwa sluufmiisi, slamí heé naa tsawaár i kaahh oo muk'eé' Israeli gu sa waawuti'iím. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala hamí daxta aníng gixsár Yerusalemu aga tsawaár dír muu aníng iwa sluufmiisi, nee kuúng Daudi muk'eé' un sawaawuti'iín.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon iri kumiít axweesanto iwa kaahi, «Baabuúeé' Daudi Doó Mungú guna ístií tsaát tleehharo as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli, kuwa baraadá' wa sluufmisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala AAKOÓ MUNGÚ baabuúeé' Daudi, gu bay, ‹Kuúng gar hhoo' aga tléhh tawa tsabiín Dooeé' kuwa tleehhamór wa sla', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ala kuúng u baloó tlehhká. Heé gu tleéhh a garmaawók kudá' ta laqwal, do'owí aníng tiwa sluufmiisi gun tleehh.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gimáy daxta, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ al'axweesantós tidá' aa oó' gaa boo/eés. Asma aníng hamí kitángw baabuúeé' Daudi ugwa óh ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira al'axweés, nee aníng Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguú Israeli kuwa sluufmiisi ugwa tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng sandakmoó alqadór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ugwa baraadá' i qaás, kudá' alqadór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ga koóm, dír múk Israeli tidá' aa tleéhh.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Solomon iri tláy iri sihhiít dír geeraá kitangwduú ilahhooa oo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, dír geeraá múk Israeli, dabaawós gay gáwtí tleés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon /aampa gaa tleéhh ar muqslár sirda/aten, gay qaás tla/ángw afeeni, tlenaango nee uroó bihheero a miíta tsár ga ba/aabá/ uro bihhe, nee tlenaangw gawa a miíta wák ga ba/aba/. Inós iri tsa/án gawaá /ampaadá', iri tumbarara'aát dír geeraá boo/oó múk Israeli, dabaawós gay gáwtí tleés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós iri firín iri oó', «Aá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli, Mungú adór kuúng i kaahh gawaá dooriwo nee baraakaá yaamuwo, oo alqaduuwós gi ohiím nee sla'aarír warqawaaká gan laqaaqán dír sagadiyuuserós sleémeero ar gu ilaiwawaa/ ar muner'ín sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng an kudá' al'axweesantók aga ot, tidá' taa ó' dír sagadiyusmoowók, baabuúeé' Daudi, hamí laarí tidá' sleémeero aa bó/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli, gimáy tidár hatlá' taa alqadiín dír baabuúeé' Daudi boo/eeseek, tidá' kuwa beér, ‹Barnaxes na/iiwók daber'eé' ngi oohiyá', nee birti harmagaahhiyá' adór kuúng wa ale, daqaní kuúng qooma sleémeero garma u koón oo iwiít gawaá kitángw aleesleemu oo Israeli.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe daxta AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli, umuú gaaro tidá' taa al'axwés dír sagadiyusmoowók Daudi boo/eeseek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Mungú, kuúng aqo tsuwa hóta baraaká daanduú yaamuwo dinkwa nee muu? Bar doori nee dooriidá' gáwtí saawá' in bu'umitiaaká, xáy, do'owí aníng naa tleéhh adór ir bu'uuti? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúeé', aníng a sagadiyusmoowók. Firór anuú sagadiyusmoowók axaseek, firor'eé' tí ni fiririim boo/eeseek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do'ók xuumeek tlatla/aangw nee xweeraawo. Do'ók kwí al'axweesani kawa ó' ar mukók uwa diirí wa sluufmiisi nee firór mukók kawa diirí wa axamis. Anuú sagadiyusmoowók firor'eé' uwa diirí wa firiim axaseek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Firor'eé' iiárií qaaseek, nee firór mukók Israeli iiárií qaaseek, qoomár bar gur'er'ín ngaa amoorí xu'usiyé'. Firoorén iiárií qaaseek gawaá doorí wa ale didár hotaawók, ti iiárií qas nee ti gurtleer.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Barnaxés hee kuqá' gwaa sadakuús, nee inós burkunga huúw dír kitaangók oo ilahhooa kay hanmamisi, as kuwa lo'ór /aymisi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, na'amaamís, iia qaaseek gawaá doorí wa ale, nee sagadiyuseerók sakwasleemuteek. Kudá' tlakweema gaa tleehh muxeek, nee kudá' ganaá' gan'amuú i harafaareek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Qoomár múk Israeli burkwa baál nee wakuuser'ín as kuúng uwa sadakuusiyé', ala birna amoorók i ki/iyé', niri hhu'u'uné', nee umuuwók nguri ya/ané', gurtleemu nguri firiné' ar tsatsa'areema baraá do'owí wa ale, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na'amaamís, iiárií qaaseek gawaá doorí wa ale. Tlakweemaá mukók oo Israeli gurtlaweek, nee inooín ki malé ki/ís baraá yaamuuín kudá' taa dir'ín i hanís nee dír baabi'ii'ín.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
