          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Qoomár tluwaay bura ilá/ as tlakweemaaín, nee aluuwo niri firór ayé' dír do'owí, umuuwók ngway ya/ané', tlakweemaaín ngiri hhu'u'uné' as kuúng kiwa múx, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na'amaamis, kuúng iiárií qaaseek gawaá doorí wa ale, tlakweemaá sagadiyuseerók gurtlaweek, mukók oo Israeli, qoomár bira intsaahhatís adór hhoo' ar nir hootiia. Daqaní AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, kuúng tluwaay ku hanís baraá yaamuuká' awa mukók, kudá' kuúng taa inooín i hanís tawa aalir'ín.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.27"
            ]
          }
        }
