              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Giyeé birna tleér baraá yaamuwo, laqaá tiqtír pu/i, laqaá slahheemasi, laqaá danú xaai birnga kahaás, laqaá ingigi birna hardát, laqaá karkari, laqaá barnaxes mukók wakuuser'ín gaa baraá gixsarkárí harwét, laqaá slahh'amu, laqaá tiqti gaalahe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuúng na'amaamís, firor'ín iiárií qaaseek. Umuú gár naa firni'i, laqaá umuú heé na qo firini, laqaá mukók oo Israeli sleémeero, slahh'amuuín barngwa tsaahhiyé' nee gurhaamir'ine, umuú heewo bira firín dabaawós gaa gáwtí tleés giri amór do'ók xu'ús, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuúng inooín iiárií qaaseek iimír gawaá doorí wa alé nee gurtlaweek. Kuúng kilók iinslawoó muunuú umuúqo hee un xú'. Kuúng tleehheek tidá' hariim dír heewo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as kahhó' kuúng uwa ilaiwa/iya', nee niwa hootiya' ar adoodá' kuúng taa ó' deelo sleémeero ar niwa hootiya' baraá yaamuudá' taa haniís dír taati'iirén.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
