          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laqaá barnaxes inooín naa hhu'u'uné' ar muner'ín sleémeero, nee ar qeereemooín sleémeero, bura firiné', gur'er'ín nga amór yaamuuín xu'usiyé', kudá' taa baabi'ii'ín i hanís, nee amór gixsarí kuúng taa tsawát, nee amór do'owí aníng naa tleéhh as kuúng, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
